   "priceMinor": 189900,
   "currency": "AED",
   "availability": "in_stock",
   "description": "\"name meaning & story AL HOSON (الحصن) means “The Fort / The Fortress.” The watch is directly inspired by Qasr Al Hoson, the historic heart of Abu Dhabi and one of the UAE’s most important cultural landmarks. Qasr Al Hoson represents strength, resilience, heritage, and timeless protection — values reflected in the watch’s design. With its clean architecture, durable materials, and elegant proportions, the AL HOSON Automatic pays tribute to the fort’s enduring presence and iconic white stone appearance, captured beautifully in the watch’s white pearl dial. movment Miyota 8205 – Automatic Mechanical Movement • 21 jewels • 21,600 vibrations per hour (3 Hz) • Bidirectional automatic winding • Quick-set day/date • Power reserve approx. 40+ hours This movement reflects Chronora’s philosophy: solid performance, longevity, and accessible luxury. Specifications Case & Build • Material: Stainless Steel 316L • Case Diameter: 40 mm • Thickness: 11.3 mm • Lug to Lug: 46 mm • Lug Width: 20 mm • Water Resistance: 50m (5 ATM) Dial • Color: Green Pearl • Lume: Swiss Super-LumiNova BGW9 Crystal • Glass: Flat Sapphire Crystal • High scratch resistance and excellent clarity Additional features • Balanced and comfortable wrist profile • Combination of brushed and polished finishing • Designed for everyday elegance and long-term durability\"",
